imalist \r\n\ud83d\udcc4 Universal Format Support:\r\nMicrosoft Word (.docx, .doc):\r\nAdobe PDF (.pdf): Off-thread web worker decoding with 3.0\u00d7 high-DPI supersampling for razor-sharp zoom and non-overlapping virtualized sheets.\r\nMarkdown (.md, .markdown): Instant GitHub-flavored Markdown parsing.\r\nSource Code & Plain Text (.txt, .json, .csv, .log, .js, .py, etc.): Zero-lag plain-text engine.\r\nImages (.png, .jpg, .jpeg, .webp, .svg, etc.): High-speed image inspection.\r\n\u2328\ufe0f 4-Directional Navigation:\r\nA / D and \u2190 / \u2192 arrow keys for smooth horizontal panning when zoomed in.\r\nW / S and \u2191 / \u2193 arrow keys for vertical document scrolling.\r\nInitial Bundle Size: 6.69 kB (JS) / 6.92 kB (CSS)\r\nResting Memory: ~95 MB\r\nCode-Splitting: 100% on-demand dynamic imports\r\nZero Bloat Policy: 0 telemetry, 0 background daemons, 0 extra files.", "name": "Free Word", "name_with_namespace": "Michael Giambra / Free Word", "path": "free-word", "path_with_namespace": "mgiambra/free-word", "created_at": "2026-08-24T21:26:14.920Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": ["docs", "documentation", "image", "pdf reader", "reader", "txt"], "topics": ["docs", "documentation", "image", "pdf reader", "reader", "txt"], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:mgiambra/free-word.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/mgiambra/free-word.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mgiambra/free-word", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/mgiambra/free-word/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/project/avatar/85717768/app.ico?v=1789170809", "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-09-11T23:53:29.657Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 137219044, "name": "Michael Giambra", "path": "mgiambra", "kind": "user", "full_path": "mgiambra", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a403bbb05f8fb2de151ac58d43f0484bb409c0fb330e973a2b0b088abce1dcf7?s=80&d=identicon", "web_url": "htt